msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/modules/quantum-mechanics/superposition-with-qiskit/extracted-outputs/d33d6191-c455-4cac-8947-0d68030278e9-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/modules/quantum-mechanics/superposition-with-qiskit/extracted-outputs/d33d6191-c455-4cac-8947-0d68030278e9-0.avif)\n"

