#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Discussion questions: {#discussion-questions}"
msgstr "Soalan perbincangan: {#discussion-questions}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Why can the state of a qubit be visualized on the Bloch sphere, but the probability distribution of a coin flip cannot?\n"
msgstr "Mengapa keadaan qubit boleh digambarkan pada sfera Bloch, tetapi taburan kebarangkalian lambungan duit syiling tidak boleh?\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Why is a coin flipping in the air not the best analogy to a quantum superposition state? What aspect of superpositions are not captured in this analogy?\n"
msgstr "Mengapa duit syiling yang berputar di udara bukan analogi terbaik kepada keadaan superposisi kuantum? Aspek superposisi apa yang tidak ditangkap dalam analogi ini?\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Challenge problems: {#challenge-problems}"
msgstr "Masalah cabaran: {#challenge-problems}"

